- Exact accepted/open/partial/filled match -> resolve as ACCEPTED.
- Exact rejected/cancelled/expired match -> resolve as rejected and permit a future submission.
- No exact match -> remain UNKNOWN and block retry.
- Multiple exact matches -> AMBIGUOUS and block retry.
- Fuzzy symbol/side/quantity matching -> deliberately forbidden.

This prevents a timeout followed by a blind retry from silently producing two live orders.

